---
description: Playwright QA locators, signup limits, seed layout, and CI boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

- Locators: getByRole, getByLabel, getByText for stable copy.
- Do not assert Function Day prices ($295, $365) or the FUNCTIONDAY26 query code. That offer ends Oct 8, 2026. Assert Start testing lands on my.functionhealth.com and the path contains /signup.
- Signup is production. Tests may open the signup page and check the form and empty-submit validation. They must not create an account, enter real personal or health data, or continue into payment.
- Seed test is tests/seed.spec.ts tagged @seed. Suites are path folders under tests/: home for `/`, signup for `/signup`.
- Locators and single-page actions belong in pages/. Multi-step journeys belong in workflows/. Specs call workflows from tests/fixtures.ts.
- CI runs deterministic Playwright only. Do not call planner, generator, or healer from CI.
